OL,3,GNEWSAGB Energy boss defends Aberdeen
OL,4,Ajob creation record
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of Great British Energy has
OL,7,Fdefended the state-owned company's job
OL,8,Fcreation record after claims its impact
OL,9,Fon Aberdeen has been oversold.
OL,11,FChief executive Dan McGrail said the
OL,12,Ffirm was recruiting about "two people a
OL,13,Fweek" for its Aberdeen-based HQ and the
OL,14,Ftotal would eventually rise to around
OL,15,F300.
OL,17,FGB Energy, which featured in Labour's
OL,18,F2024 election manifesto, was
OL,19,Festablished last year to provide
OL,20,Finvestment for UK clean energy
OL,21,Fprojects.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
