OL,3,GNEWSAGB Energy boss defends Aberdeen
OL,4,Ajob creation record
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcGrail said it had already made three
OL,7,Fmajor investments which would
OL,8,Findirectly trigger about 1,500 jobs and
OL,9,Fit had a target of helping to create
OL,10,F10,000 jobs by 2030.
